{"path":"io/basic_ostream/put","title":"std::basic_ostream<CharT,Traits>::put","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_ostream&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>put","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream/put","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Behaves as an UnformattedOutputFunction. After constructing and checking the sentry object, writes the character ch to the output stream.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">basic_ostream<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> put<span class=\"br0\">(</span> char_type ch <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Behaves as an <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/UnformattedOutputFunction\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">UnformattedOutputFunction</em></a>. After constructing and checking the sentry object, writes the character <code>ch</code> to the output stream.\n</p><p>If the output fails for any reason, sets <code>badbit</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  ch\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  character to write\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>This function is not overloaded for the types <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">signed</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span></span></code> or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span></span></code>, unlike the formatted <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream/operator_ltlt2\">operator&lt;&lt;</a>.\n</p><p>Unlike formatted output functions, this function does not set the <code>failbit</code> if the output fails.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;fstream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">put</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">'a'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// normal usage</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">put</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ofstream\"><span class=\"kw1750\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ofstream</span></span></a> s<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"/does/not/exist/\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    s.<span class=\"me1\">clear</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// pretend the stream is good</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Unformatted output: \"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    s.<span class=\"me1\">put</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">'c'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// this will set badbit, but not failbit</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" fail=\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>s.<span class=\"me1\">rdstate</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> s.<span class=\"me1\">failbit</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" bad=\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s.<span class=\"me1\">bad</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    s.<span class=\"me1\">clear</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Formatted output:   \"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    s <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'c'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// this will set badbit and failbit</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" fail=\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>s.<span class=\"me1\">rdstate</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> s.<span class=\"me1\">failbit</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" bad=\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s.<span class=\"me1\">bad</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>a\nUnformatted output:  fail=0 bad=1\nFormatted output:    fail=1 bad=1</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream/operator_ltlt2\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator&lt;&lt;<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">(std::basic_ostream)</span></span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  inserts character data or insert into rvalue stream <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream/write\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>write</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  inserts blocks of characters <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_ostream","title":"std::basic_ostream"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_ostream<CharT,Traits>::put","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Behaves as an UnformattedOutputFunction."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"ch"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"},{"label":"Notes","note":"This function is not overloaded for the types signed char or unsigned char, unlike the formatted operator<<."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"operator<<(std::basic_ostream)","note":"inserts character data or insert into rvalue stream"},{"label":"write","note":"inserts blocks of characters"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":191,"codeBlockCount":2}
